# This slice's route through the front door — see forgejo/caddy.caddyfile
# for the shape's rationale. The upstream is GLUETUN, not qbittorrent:
# qbittorrent shares gluetun's network namespace (see compose.yaml), so
# on the lab network its web UI answers at the gluetun container's name.
# NB: qBittorrent validates the Host header — BOTH hostnames must be in
# its WebUI "Server domains" setting (a bootstrap step in README.md).
@qbittorrent host qbittorrent.lab.twolfe.dev qbittorrent.ts.twolfe.dev
handle @qbittorrent {
	reverse_proxy gluetun:8080
}
